  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan", "title": "Describe It, step by step",
      "items": [
        "Ithaca POSTs /v1/pick with the viewer's token for the Plex server (never their account token) and the titles that fit",
        "503 until a Plex server is chosen; 401 unless plex.tv's share list has the token, or lists the server for it as an account",
        "Non-owners past the daily limit get 429; Ithaca's paired picks and suggestions count once",
        "answer(): suggest 0 with a TypeSafe key goes to Jev; a Jev failure falls back to the chosen model",
        "Picks are cut to ids the request sent; the outcome and its cost estimate (prices.ts) go to athena.db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose", "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Home network: compose publishes :8800 on one address (127.0.0.1 by default), never 0.0.0.0",
        "Internet: friends reach Athena only through the owner's HTTPS reverse proxy",
        "Athena container: API keys live in settings.json (mode 600, umask 077); it runs as 99:100",
        "Viewers' Plex tokens: SHA-256 hashes in PlexGate's cache; only the owner's is saved, to read the share list",
        "Third-party AI gets the request text and library titles; a local model keeps them on the LAN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet", "title": "Settings and web UI",
      "items": [
        "Live (live.ts) is the API's deps object: a save rebuilds the AI client, and PlexGate when the server changes",
        "Env vars (PLEX_URL, ATHENA_PROVIDER, ATHENA_MODEL, *_API_KEY) win over settings.json and show locked",
        "Only the Plex server's owner saves; before a server is chosen, the first person to sign in sets it up",
        "Settings Test runs a 3-title sample through makeAI and ai.pick, without logging it",
        "The status page reads athena.db; Share renders the ithaca://athena?url= link and its QR code (share.ts)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate", "title": "Deployment",
      "items": [
        "Dockerfile: oven/bun image, PORT 8800, ATHENA_DATA=/data, healthcheck on GET /healthz",
        "docker-compose.yml mounts ./data:/data for settings.json and athena.db",
        "entrypoint.sh gives /data to PUID:PGID (99:100) and drops root",
        "With PLEX_URL set, PlexGate reads that Plex server's /identity for its machine id, then asks plex.tv"
      ]
    }
  ]
